N\\)</span> (arity)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> (candidate total number-theoretic function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span> (arithmetic signature)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> (Robinson arithmetic, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3f44d69945b890a4\" href=\"?note=3f44d69945b890a4\" title=\"88-df-robinson-arithmetic\">88-df-robinson-arithmetic</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (candidate arithmetic theory)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R\">\\(\\mathcal R\\)</span> (inference-rule parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k\\)</span> (arity-indexed primitive-recursive predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rule}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Rule}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\)</span> (inference-rule predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c7ab6c8e893872fb\" href=\"?note=c7ab6c8e893872fb\" title=\"88-df-inference-rule\">88-df-inference-rule</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RepFn}_{T,\\mathcal R}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{RepFn}_{T,\\mathcal R}(f)\\)</span> (function-representability predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b9c2b3bb904b3813\" href=\"?note=b9c2b3bb904b3813\" title=\"88-df-representable-function\">88-df-representable-function</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}representability} \\vdash\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall f\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Theory}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(T)\n\\land Q\\subseteq T\n\\land\\mathrm{Rule}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(\\mathcal R)\n\\land\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k(f)\n\\to\n\\mathrm{RepFn}_{T,\\mathcal R}(f)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}representability} \\vdash\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall f\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Theory}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(T)\n\\land Q\\subseteq T\n\\land\\mathrm{Rule}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(\\mathcal R)\n\\land\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k(f)\n\\to\n\\mathrm{RepFn}_{T,\\mathcal R}(f)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k(f)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>元原始递归函数谓词 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"2f808bc294509a7d\" href=\"?note=2f808bc294509a7d\" title=\"88-df-primitive-recursive\">88-df-primitive-recursive</a>)</li>\n<li>结论复用函数图的完整可表示性定义，避免原式中未量化的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span>以及只给正例、不排除错误输出的问题。</li>\n<li>原始递归函数可在 Robinson 算术中表示，因而也可在 PA 中表示。</li>\n<li>算术化的基础工具</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-representable-function","status":"resolved","id":"b9c2b3bb904b3813","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-representable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"2f808bc294509a7d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-primitive-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"3f44d69945b890a4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"def3025c6c81c740","a